OL,3,ASecond storm to hit UK with more wind
OL,4,Aand rain as thousands remain without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FA second storm in as many days is set
OL,8,Fto batter parts of the UK, as thousands
OL,9,Fof homes remain without power following
OL,10,Fpowerful winds and heavy rain on
OL,11,FFriday.
OL,13,FStorm Boelo is forecast to hit on
OL,14,FSaturday, with an amber weather warning
OL,15,Fissued from 21:00 BST across much of
OL,16,FScotland as well as parts of Northern
OL,17,FIreland and northern England where
OL,18,Fgusts of up to 80mph (128km/h) could
OL,19,Flash exposed areas.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
