OL,3,ASecond storm to hit UK with more wind
OL,4,Aand rain as thousands remain without
OL,5,Apower
OL,6,
OL,7,FTravel chaos, power cuts and localised
OL,8,Fflooding are all possible as the storm
OL,9,Fsweeps in on Saturday.
OL,11,FThe warning comes just one day after
OL,12,FStorm Austen unleashed wind gusts in
OL,13,Fexcess of 75mph, resulting in toppled
OL,14,Ftrees, transport disruption and
OL,15,Fthousands of power outages.
